# NovusAI SaaS 开发规则

> 本文件仅作为旧版 Cursor 兼容入口。**规范正文以 `.trellis/spec/**` 与 `.trellis/workflow.md` 为准**，请勿在此文件中添加具体规则。

## 权威入口

- **总纲**：[.trellis/workflow.md](.trellis/workflow.md) — Trellis 路径、任务契约、上下文与验证规则
- **后端规范**：[.trellis/spec/backend/index.md](.trellis/spec/backend/index.md)
- **前端规范**：[.trellis/spec/frontend/index.md](.trellis/spec/frontend/index.md)
- **AI Runtime 规范**：[.trellis/spec/ai-runtime/index.md](.trellis/spec/ai-runtime/index.md)
- **思维与跨层指南**：[.trellis/spec/guides/index.md](.trellis/spec/guides/index.md)

## 专题规则

| 主题 | 规范入口 |
|------|------|
| AI / Agent / Skill | [.trellis/spec/ai-runtime/index.md](.trellis/spec/ai-runtime/index.md) |
| 上传 / 下载 / 存储 | [.trellis/spec/guides/index.md](.trellis/spec/guides/index.md) |
| Celery / 通知 / Socket.IO | [.trellis/spec/backend/logging-guidelines.md](.trellis/spec/backend/logging-guidelines.md) |
| 插件系统 | [.trellis/spec/guides/plugin-runtime-playbook.md](.trellis/spec/guides/plugin-runtime-playbook.md) |
| RBAC / 数据权限 | [.trellis/spec/guides/cross-layer-thinking-guide.md](.trellis/spec/guides/cross-layer-thinking-guide.md) |
| 用户端 / 域名隔离 | [.trellis/spec/frontend/index.md](.trellis/spec/frontend/index.md) |
| 测试 / 验证 | [.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md](.trellis/spec/backend/quality-guidelines.md), [.trellis/spec/frontend/quality-guidelines.md](.trellis/spec/frontend/quality-guidelines.md) |
| Alembic 迁移 | [.trellis/spec/backend/database-guidelines.md](.trellis/spec/backend/database-guidelines.md) |
| Trace / 监控 | [.trellis/spec/backend/logging-guidelines.md](.trellis/spec/backend/logging-guidelines.md) |
| 企业端架构 | [.trellis/spec/guides/cross-layer-thinking-guide.md](.trellis/spec/guides/cross-layer-thinking-guide.md) |
| 菜单 / 多语言 | [.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md](.trellis/spec/frontend/component-guidelines.md) |

## 参考文档

如需兼容旧入口，可再跳转到 `.cursor/rules/novusai-saas.md`，但不要把它视为权威正文。
